---
/** /review — open call for methodological review. The landing point for outreach letters:
 *  a reviewer should understand the ask, the artifact and the rules within five minutes. */
import DocPage from './DocPage.astro';
import { localizePath, type Locale } from '../../i18n/ui';
import { getManifest, getSources } from '../../lib/data-server';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, DATA_DOI } from '../../lib/site';
interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh-Hant' || locale === 'zh-Hans';
const manifest = getManifest();
const src = getSources()?.['unhcr_population'];
---

<DocPage
  locale={locale}
  title={zh ? '公開徵求方法論審查' : 'Open call: review our methodology'}
  lede={zh
    ? '在向全世界推薦本站之前，我們想先被熟悉這些資料陷阱的人批評。所有意見與我們的回應都將全文公開。'
    : 'Before recommending this site to the world, we want it criticised by people who know this data’s traps. Every comment and our response will be published in full.'}
>
  <h2>{zh ? '請求是什麼' : 'The ask'}</h2>
  {
    zh ? (
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>一到兩小時</strong>，未來六週內任何時間。
        </li>
        <li>
          讀<a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>方法論</a>與
          <a href={localizePath('/methodology/definitions', locale)}>定義變遷年表</a>
          ，隨意戳資料，把「哪裡錯了、哪裡缺了、哪裡會誤導」寄給我們。
        </li>
        <li>
          意見與回應全文公開於本頁；<strong>具名或匿名由您決定</strong>。
        </li>
        <li>沒有報酬——只有公開的致謝，與一個會被您的學生引用的資源因您而變好。</li>
      </ul>
    ) : (
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>One to two hours</strong>, any time in the next six weeks.
        </li>
        <li>
          Read the <a href={localizePath('/methodology', locale)}>methodology</a> and the{' '}
          <a href={localizePath('/methodology/definitions', locale)}>definitions timeline</a>, poke
          the data, and send us what is wrong, missing, or misleading.
        </li>
        <li>
          Comments and our responses are published in full on this page —{' '}
          <strong>attributed or anonymous, your choice</strong>.
        </li>
        <li>
          No payment — only public acknowledgement, and a resource your students may cite made
          better by you.
        </li>
      </ul>
    )
  }

  <h2>{zh ? '五分鐘審查包' : 'The five-minute reviewer pack'}</h2>
  {
    zh ? (
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>它是什麼</strong>：UNHCR／IDMC／UN WPP 公開統計的可驗證轉載層——內容位址快照、季度
          DOI（
          <a href={`https://doi.org/${DATA_DOI}`}>
            <code>{DATA_DOI}</code>
          </a>
          ）、每日公開驗證、七種語言的指標定義。不生產數據，生產引用所需的嚴謹性。
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>自我檢驗</strong>：每日 24 項自動檢查、其中 18 條資料不變量（含「可上色總和＋無法顯示總和＝全球總計」對全部指標×75 年成立；三個黃金數字容差
          1%）。目前快照 <code>{manifest?.snapshot_id}</code>
          ，資料截至 {src?.data_as_of}。
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>已知限制（先自首）</strong>：未報告≠零的全鏈路呈現仰賴上游 "-" 記號的正確性；IDP
          僅衝突與暴力；OIP 造成 2018 斷點；即時層為估計；個別數值尚未逐筆與上游介面比對（僅黃金數字與總和恆等式）。
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>最歡迎的批評</strong>：定義表述的法律準確性（七語）、注意事項是否有遺漏、
          「負責任引用」守則是否站得住、視覺化是否有無意的誤導。
        </li>
      </ol>
    ) : (
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>What it is</strong>: a verifiable republication layer over UNHCR / IDMC / UN WPP
          statistics — content-addressed snapshots, a quarterly DOI (
          <a href={`https://doi.org/${DATA_DOI}`}>
            <code>{DATA_DOI}</code>
          </a>
          ), daily public validation, metric definitions in seven languages. It produces no data; it
          produces the rigour needed to cite data.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Self-checks</strong>: 24 daily automated checks — 18 data invariants (incl. mapped + unmappable = global
          total for every metric × 75 years; three golden numbers within 1%). Current snapshot{' '}
          <code>{manifest?.snapshot_id}</code>, data as of {src?.data_as_of}.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Known limits (we confess first)</strong>: the null≠zero chain trusts the upstream
          "-" convention; IDPs cover conflict/violence only; OIP creates a 2018 break; the live
          layer is estimates; individual cell values are not yet reconciled row-by-row against the upstream interface (only golden numbers and sum identities are).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Criticism we most want</strong>: legal accuracy of the definitions (in all seven
          languages), missing caveats, whether the responsible-citation rules hold up, and any
          unintentionally misleading visualisation.
        </li>
      </ol>
    )
  }

  <h2>{zh ? '如何回覆' : 'How to respond'}</h2>
  <p>
    {zh ? '寄至 ' : 'Write to '}
    <a
      href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('[Where They Went] Methodology review')}`}
      >{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a
    >{
      zh
        ? '，格式不拘——條列、批注過的截圖、一封長信都好。收到後我們會逐點回應，並詢問您希望的署名方式後才公開。'
        : ' — any format: bullet points, annotated screenshots, one long e-mail. We will respond point by point, and ask how you wish to be credited before anything is published.'
    }
  </p>

  <h2>{zh ? '已收到的審查' : 'Reviews received'}</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    {
      zh
        ? '本頁刊載每一份審查意見與我們的回應——包括我們答不上來的部分。人工審查尚未收到;以下是自動化程式審查的結果。'
        : 'Every review and our response is published here — including the parts we cannot answer. No human review has arrived yet; below is an automated one.'
    }
  </p>

  <h3>
    {zh
      ? '2026-09-05 · 自動化程式審查（由維護者委託的 AI 進行）'
      : '2026-09-05 · Automated code review (an AI, commissioned by the maintainer)'}
  </h3>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          審查範圍為完整原始碼與線上網站。結論是不需要重寫架構,但指出<strong
            >三項會影響公開陳述的語意缺陷</strong
          >與四項讀者可見的錯誤。我們逐條查證後全部確認成立,並在同一天修正。這些是我們自己沒有抓到的:
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          A full pass over the source and the live site. It found no reason to rewrite the
          architecture, and <strong>three semantic defects affecting published claims</strong>{' '}
          plus four reader-facing bugs. We reproduced every one of them in the code and fixed them
          the same day. We had not caught any of these ourselves:
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      {
        zh ? (
          <>
            首頁「每 N 人中有 1 人被迫流離失所」的分子誤用<strong>受關注人口總數</strong
            >,其中含無國籍者與其他受關注者(約 6%)。已改由「難民 + 庇護申請者 + IDP + OIP」計算,
            數字自「每 71 人」更正為「每 76 人」。（
            <a href={localizePath('/methodology#displaced-vs-poc', locale)}>方法論說明</a>）
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            The home page's "1 in every N people is forcibly displaced" was computed from{' '}
            <strong>total people of concern</strong>, which also carries stateless persons and
            others of concern (~6%). It is now computed from refugees + asylum-seekers + IDPs +
            OIP, and the published figure moves from 1 in 71 to 1 in 76. (
            <a href={localizePath('/methodology#displaced-vs-poc', locale)}>methodology</a>)
          </>
        )
      }
    </li>
    <li>
      {
        zh ? (
          <>
            指標的可用視角在資料中早有定義,但程式從未讀取它——<code>?m=stateless&amp;v=origin</code
            >會把居住國數字放在來源國標題下。（
            <a href={localizePath('/methodology#metric-views', locale)}>方法論說明</a>）
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            The data had always declared which view each metric exists in, but nothing in the app
            read it — <code>?m=stateless&amp;v=origin</code> put residence figures under an origin
            heading. (<a href={localizePath('/methodology#metric-views', locale)}>methodology</a>)
          </>
        )
      }
    </li>
    <li>
      {zh
        ? '衍生指標的引用與下載只標示 UNHCR,但其中的 IDP 數字來自 IDMC。現在每一份引用與匯出都列出實際用到的每一個來源。'
        : 'Citations and downloads for derived metrics credited UNHCR alone, although their IDP component comes from IDMC. Every citation and export now lists every source actually used.'}
    </li>
    <li>
      {zh
        ? '切換語言會丟掉整串查詢參數(國家、年份、指標);比較頁分享後國家順序與顏色會對調;每千人比率小於 0.01 時顯示為「0」,而本站的「0」意思是「來源報告為零」;首次造訪時導覽卡覆蓋圖例。'
        : 'Switching language discarded the entire query string (countries, year, metric); shared comparison links came back with the rows and colours swapped; per-1,000 rates below 0.01 printed as "0", which on this site means "the source reported zero"; and on a first visit the tour card covered the legend.'}
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    {
      zh ? (
        <>
          每一項修正都附帶會失敗的測試,資料層另加兩條不變量(第 17、18
          條)防止復發。<strong>尚未處理</strong>:國家搜尋下拉的鍵盤操作模型(方向鍵、Escape、
          <code>aria-activedescendant</code>)仍不完整。
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          Each fix ships with a test that fails against the previous build, and the data layer
          gained two invariants (#17, #18) so the two semantic defects cannot return.{' '}
          <strong>Still outstanding</strong>: the keyboard interaction model for the country search
          comboboxes (arrow keys, Escape, <code>aria-activedescendant</code>) is incomplete.
        </>
      )
    }
  </p>
</DocPage>
